# Component Dependencies - Required Installations

## 🎯 QUICK REFERENCE: What to Install When

This guide ensures you always install the right shadcn components for each use case.

## 📊 DASHBOARD COMPONENTS

### **Analytics Dashboard (Complete)**
```bash
# REQUIRED components:
npx shadcn@latest add button card input label badge dialog dropdown-menu

# For data tables (ReUI):
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator

# For charts (if needed):
# Recharts is already installed via npm
```

### **Metric Cards**
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add card badge
```

### **Interactive Charts**
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add card
# Recharts already installed
```

### **Data Grids/Tables**
```bash
# ReUI Data Grid (MANDATORY for tables):
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator button badge
```

