## 📋 PRE-INSTALLATION COMMANDS

### **Complete Dashboard Setup (Recommended)**
```bash
# Install all dashboard essentials at once:
npx shadcn@latest add button card input label badge dialog dropdown-menu alert skeleton avatar separator

# Add ReUI Data Grid:
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
npx shadcn@latest add command popover

# Optional advanced components:
npx shadcn@latest add navigation-menu sheet toast tabs accordion
```

### **Complete Form Setup**
```bash
# Install all form essentials:
npx shadcn@latest add input label button card textarea select checkbox radio-group switch form alert
```

### **Complete Landing Page Setup**
```bash
# Install all landing page essentials:
npx shadcn@latest add button card badge navigation-menu sheet dialog alert
```

## 🚨 CRITICAL INSTALLATION ORDER

1. **ALWAYS install basic components first:**
   ```bash
   npx shadcn@latest add button card input label
   ```

2. **Then install feature-specific components:**
   ```bash
   npx shadcn@latest add badge dialog dropdown-menu
   ```

3. **Finally install complex components:**
   ```bash
   npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
   npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator
   ```

## 🔍 DEPENDENCY VERIFICATION

### **Check if Component Exists**
```bash
# Verify installation:
ls src/components/ui/

# Check specific component:
ls src/components/ui/button.tsx
```

### **Common Missing Dependencies**
```tsx
// If you see import errors for these, install them:

// Command palette/search:
npx shadcn@latest add command

// Dropdowns and popovers:
npx shadcn@latest add popover dropdown-menu

// Layout helpers:
npx shadcn@latest add separator

// Form components:
npx shadcn@latest add select textarea checkbox radio-group

// Feedback components:
npx shadcn@latest add alert toast

// Data display:
npx shadcn@latest add table avatar skeleton
```

## ⚡ QUICK DEPENDENCY FIXES

### **For "Cannot find module" errors:**

1. **Identify the missing component** from the error message
2. **Install it immediately:**
   ```bash
   npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
   ```
3. **Restart your dev server:**
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

### **For ReUI Data Grid errors:**
```bash
# Complete ReUI setup:
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator button badge
```

## 📝 USAGE IN RULES

When creating rules or templates, always include:

```markdown
### Required Dependencies
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add button card input label
```

### Component Usage
```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Card } from "@/components/ui/card";
// ... rest of component
```
```

This ensures users know exactly what to install before using your component templates.

